WEBVTT

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:11.040
One key area is EU funding. Ireland gets support for agriculture, infrastructure, education and regional development.

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:20.040
The government could do more to help businesses, community groups and local organisations understand how to apply for this funding.

00:00:20.040 --> 00:00:23.040
With support, more of these groups could benefit and grow.
